      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "28 tests passed at the seat-retrieval checkpoint. They prove current rules, API contracts, migrations, constraints, deterministic seed behavior, and repository queries.\nThey do not yet prove simultaneous-request behavior, reservation confirmation, iOS behavior, CI behavior, performance, or production scale.",
      "rawText": "28 tests passed at the seat-retrieval checkpoint. They prove current rules, API contracts, migrations, constraints, deterministic seed behavior, and repository queries.\nThey do not yet prove simultaneous-request behavior, reservation confirmation, iOS behavior, CI behavior, performance, or production scale.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "28 tests passed at the seat-retrieval checkpoint. They prove current rules, API contracts, migrations, constraints, deterministic seed behavior, and repository queries.\nThey do not yet prove simultaneous-request behavior, reservation confirmation, iOS behavior, CI behavior, performance, or production scale.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
